When working in `apps/shell`, `apps/mfe-products`, or `apps/mfe-cart`:

Read [apps/docs/AGENTS.md](../../apps/docs/AGENTS.md) for full rules. Apply these conventions:

## Feature folders

- Put feature code under `src/features/<feature-name>/` (`components/`, `hooks/`, `lib/`, `types.ts`).
- Keep `src/pages/` (shell) as **thin** route entries that compose from `features/`.
- Federation expose files at `src/` root may re-export from a feature; prefer moving UI into `features/` first.

## Kebab-case files and folders

- **Files and directories:** kebab-case (`products-page.tsx`, `features/cart-route/`).
- **React components:** PascalCase identifiers in kebab-case files (`CartWidget` in `cart-widget.tsx`).
- **Hooks:** `use-*` files, camelCase exports (`use-user.ts` → `useUser`).

Do not add new PascalCase or camelCase **filenames**.
